@startuml
[*] --> Order : Newly acquired plane
Order --> Arrival : Upon arrival
Arrival --> Preparation : Upon arrival
alt Condition and schedule ->> Operations : Plane is assigned to operations
alt Condition and schedule ->> Maintenance : Plane is assigned to maintenance
Preparation --> Operations : Plane is ready for operations
Operations --> Maintenance : No more scheduled flights or maintenance required
Maintenance --> Preparation : After checking and servicing
Operations --> Withdrawn from service : Permanently withdrawn
Withdrawn from service --> [*] : Final state

@enduml
